    {
      "id": "pcKnSVYhrdamms0S01r87",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 799,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 882.5995483398438,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ewkmwtBfe_fr4w0MtPmZo",
      "index": "ZzzzzzzzzzzzzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 487339244,
      "version": 2568,
      "versionNonce": 2090753058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788294026483,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Initialization:\n- Takes start and end of region to manage [start, end)\n    Sanity check values\n    Aligns start up to PAGE_SIZE\n    Aligns end down to PAGE_SIZE\n- Calculates necessary metadata size\n    - size / PAGE_SIZE = number of managed pages = number of bits needed = nb\n    - DIV_ROUND_UP(nb, BITS_PER_WORD) = bitmap_words\n    - bitmap_words * (sizeof ulong) = number of bytes needed = N = bitmap_bytes\n    - DIV_ROUND_UP(N, PAGE_SIZE) = number of metadata pages = reserved pages = rp\n- Set all metadata pages to 1 -> initializes whole bitmap to 1\n- Clears PFN range [rp, nb)\n- Sets search_hint to rp\n\nAllocation:\n- iterate until word i != ~0 -> word i has at least one free bit\n    For 1 page, expected iteration count is 1, since we have search_hint\n  Iteration must wrap around\n    Easier to split search into two intervals [search_hint, nb) and [rp, search_hint)\n- bit index = __builtin_ctzl(~byte) = j\n- Set bit j to 1\n- page_index = i * BITS_PER_WORD + j\n- decision: no need to update search hint. let it wrap around naturally.\n- return PAddress region_base + page_index * PAGE_SIZE\n\nFreeing:\n- Argument is physical address of page\n    Calculate page index = (address - region_base) / PAGE_SIZE\n    bitmap word = index / BITS_PER_WORD\n    bit_index = index % BITS_PER_WORD\n- Clear bit_index of bitmap_word\n    Check for double free -> panic, since in kernel mode\n- search_hint = min(search_hint, page_index)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Initialization:\n- Takes start and end of region to manage [start, end)\n    Sanity check values\n    Aligns start up to PAGE_SIZE\n    Aligns end down to PAGE_SIZE\n- Calculates necessary metadata size\n    - size / PAGE_SIZE = number of managed pages = number of bits needed = nb\n    - DIV_ROUND_UP(nb, BITS_PER_WORD) = bitmap_words\n    - bitmap_words * (sizeof ulong) = number of bytes needed = N = bitmap_bytes\n    - DIV_ROUND_UP(N, PAGE_SIZE) = number of metadata pages = reserved pages = rp\n- Set all metadata pages to 1 -> initializes whole bitmap to 1\n- Clears PFN range [rp, nb)\n- Sets search_hint to rp\n\nAllocation:\n- iterate until word i != ~0 -> word i has at least one free bit\n    For 1 page, expected iteration count is 1, since we have search_hint\n  Iteration must wrap around\n    Easier to split search into two intervals [search_hint, nb) and [rp, search_hint)\n- bit index = __builtin_ctzl(~byte) = j\n- Set bit j to 1\n- page_index = i * BITS_PER_WORD + j\n- decision: no need to update search hint. let it wrap around naturally.\n- return PAddress region_base + page_index * PAGE_SIZE\n\nFreeing:\n- Argument is physical address of page\n    Calculate page index = (address - region_base) / PAGE_SIZE\n    bitmap word = index / BITS_PER_WORD\n    bit_index = index % BITS_PER_WORD\n- Clear bit_index of bitmap_word\n    Check for double free -> panic, since in kernel mode\n- search_hint = min(search_hint, page_index)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YHaQ9374k5m-TuYSCc6jw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 491,
      "y": 644,
      "width": 237.53988647460938,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ewkmwtBfe_fr4w0MtPmZo",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1833208684,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 1242429402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788121772828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "useful macros:\nDIV_ROUND_UP(x, n) =\n   (x + n - 1) / n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "useful macros:\nDIV_ROUND_UP(x, n) =\n   (x + n - 1) / n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GsQVG7yLU56aDmUc2M5ds",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 492,
      "y": 741,
      "width": 207.5598907470703,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ewkmwtBfe_fr4w0MtPmZo",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 526048748,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 533826246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788121772828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ALIGN_DOWN(x, n) =\n   x & ~(n-1)\n     n is 2^k",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ALIGN_DOWN(x, n) =\n   x & ~(n-1)\n     n is 2^k",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PVpK9442_Kolo3hBqkEZ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 482,
      "y": 834,
      "width": 282.83984375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ewkmwtBfe_fr4w0MtPmZo",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzzx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2126277100,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 670428314,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788121772828,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ALIGN_UP(x, n) =\n   ALIGN_DOWN(x + n - 1, n)\n      (x + n - 1) & ~(n-1)\n   n is 2^k",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ALIGN_UP(x, n) =\n   ALIGN_DOWN(x + n - 1, n)\n      (x + n - 1) & ~(n-1)\n   n is 2^k",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
